            "description": "Deploy/bootstrap column \u2014 anchored on the GitHub Actions OIDC provider (token.actions.githubusercontent.com). Members: the deploy IAM role, the Terraform state S3 bucket, the Terraform state DynamoDB lock table. Vertical column under the anchor.",
